    "title": "Savannah-Chatham County BOE to vote on District 2 replacement - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mackenzie Baker ,\n1 days ago SAVANNAH, Ga. (WTOC) - The Savannah-Chatham County Board of Education (BOE) meets Tuesday to decide who will fill the vacant District 2 seat previously held by Dr. Dionne Hoskins-Brown. In March, Dr. Hoskins-Brown announced her intentions to run for another public office - Board President. Under Georgia law, the seat... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
